E8538 `Markup()` wraps a concatenation: the values were interpolated before the wrap, so none of them was escaped
  --> E8538.py:10:9
   |
 9 |     def bad(self, name, url):
10 |         Markup("<b>" + name + "</b>")  # E8538
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
11 |         Markup(self.env._("Hello %(name)s", name=name))  # E8538
12 |         Markup(_("Hello %s", name))  # E8538
   |
help: Wrap the template, then format it

